cheat half 0
cheat god
cheat nospawn
cheat notimer
cheat deaths 3
cheat pos 100 144
wait 200
expect eshots_3 == 0
cheat deaths 4
waituntil eshots_3 >= 1 200
# crows: one volley of three, or three of three
